<h3 nodeId="n222m">5.2 上下文工程技术拆解</h3>
<table responsive="false" nodeId="n222">
<tr nodeId="n223">
<th colwidth="[151]" nodeId="n224a">
<p nodeId="n225a">关键技术（第 4 章）</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[770]" nodeId="n226a">
<p nodeId="n227a">在平台方向的落地方式</p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[600.9921875]" nodeId="n228a">
<p nodeId="n229b">效果/收益（来源）</p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="n230">
<td colwidth="[151]" nodeId="n231">
<p nodeId="n232"><strong>渐进式披露</strong></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[770]" nodeId="n233a">
<p nodeId="n234a"><strong>4 层 Skill 智能路由演进</strong><km-footnote id="08afe69b-bbea-4ab7-a652-774bb02328de" annotate="" nodeId="2caf806e43c446afbd343cc9b2c9e1cb" />：V1 全量注入→V2 Skill Map 结构化索引→V3 SubAgent 分层隔离→V4 语义召回（BM25+Embedding，138 Skill/1,026 功能点）</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[600.9921875]" nodeId="n235a">
<p nodeId="n236a">主 Agent Skill 路由准确率 42%→92%；子 Agent pass⁵ 33%→87%</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="n237a">
<td colwidth="[151]" nodeId="n238">
<p nodeId="n239"><strong>持久化记忆</strong></p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[770]" nodeId="n240">
<p nodeId="n241"><strong>知识冷启动三步法</strong>：① 存量蒸馏，将已有排查经验批量转化为结构化知识；② 增量采集，AI 无法解决的问题，人给 AI 输入解决思路后沉淀为 Skill/知识库；③ 教学投喂，管理员主动写入规则与 SOP</p>
</td>
<td colwidth="[600.9921875]" nodeId="n242a">
